WEBVTT

00:01:42.850 --> 00:01:45.590
Toshi! Matsu! Please don't do this!

00:01:45.680 --> 00:01:48.180
For the two of you to
fight against Kenshin is...

00:02:03.790 --> 00:02:06.240
Lord Kenshin.

00:02:06.330 --> 00:02:09.870
The army led by Maeda
Toshiie and his wife, Matsu,

00:02:09.960 --> 00:02:12.500
is approaching our border.

00:02:12.590 --> 00:02:15.790
Their numbers and configuration
are as we had estimated.

00:02:15.880 --> 00:02:19.000
It appears they intend to strike
us head-on with their entire army,

00:02:19.090 --> 00:02:21.960
which includes their arquebus corps.

00:02:23.390 --> 00:02:26.630
How very like the upright Lord Toshiie.

00:02:26.730 --> 00:02:28.230
Where has Keiji gone?

00:02:28.310 --> 00:02:31.970
My lord, he should be coming
upon the Maeda Army presently.

00:02:32.060 --> 00:02:33.600
Knowing that man,

00:02:33.690 --> 00:02:38.430
I believe he will try to convince
them to halt their invasion.

00:02:38.530 --> 00:02:40.320
I see.

00:02:44.910 --> 00:02:49.200
Though it pains me,
we shall proceed as planned.

00:02:49.290 --> 00:02:51.080
Yes, Sir.

00:02:52.750 --> 00:02:56.120
May Bishamonten's divine
protection go with you.

00:03:08.730 --> 00:03:10.510
Whoa!

00:03:17.900 --> 00:03:21.360
Toshi! Matsu!

00:03:24.700 --> 00:03:26.990
My lord Inuchiyo, it is Keiji.

00:03:27.080 --> 00:03:28.780
We will not be stopping, Matsu.

00:03:28.870 --> 00:03:29.660
What?

00:03:29.750 --> 00:03:31.780
We will press on.

00:03:33.130 --> 00:03:35.080
Understood, my lord.

00:03:36.130 --> 00:03:40.290
Please stop! Toshi! Matsu!
Listen to what I have to--

00:03:51.310 --> 00:03:53.890
Toshi! Matsu!

00:04:00.400 --> 00:04:02.230
So he's saying it's not open for discussion...

00:04:02.320 --> 00:04:05.110
Leave it to Lord Kenshin.

00:04:05.200 --> 00:04:06.730
Kasuga...

00:04:06.830 --> 00:04:09.240
Go journey wherever the road may take you.

00:04:09.330 --> 00:04:12.540
It will only be painful
for you to witness this war.

00:04:12.620 --> 00:04:15.370
And you will only be in the way for us.

00:04:17.380 --> 00:04:21.090
My lord has said that he
will do everything in his power.

00:04:48.410 --> 00:04:51.700
Lord Uesugi Kenshin,
War God of Echigo, I presume?

00:04:51.790 --> 00:04:55.620
I am Maeda Toshiie, keeper of the land of Kaga.

00:04:55.710 --> 00:04:58.320
And I am his wife, Matsu.

00:04:58.420 --> 00:05:00.500
I have heard much about you.

00:05:01.880 --> 00:05:04.090
You have always been
good to Keiji, my nephew...

00:05:04.170 --> 00:05:07.880
My lord Inuchiyo, he is
our opponent in war now.

00:05:09.100 --> 00:05:15.060
Lord Uesugi, surely you do not mean
to engage us with such a paltry force.

00:05:15.140 --> 00:05:17.430
You may be renowned as a War God, but...

00:05:17.520 --> 00:05:20.980
These fields of Echigo...

00:05:21.070 --> 00:05:24.600
I have no intention of staining
them with the blood of war.

00:05:24.700 --> 00:05:30.280
Withdraw immediately,
Lord Toshiie and Lady Matsu.

00:05:30.370 --> 00:05:35.030
I have sent the entirety
of the Uesugi Army to Kaga.

00:05:35.120 --> 00:05:36.410
What a...!

00:05:36.500 --> 00:05:39.240
Needless to say, they
will bring down your castle,

00:05:39.330 --> 00:05:43.330
and inevitably embroil
innocents in the process.

00:05:43.420 --> 00:05:46.330
That is the price you pay
for allying with Toyotomi

00:05:46.430 --> 00:05:48.960
and attempting to invade my lands.

00:05:49.050 --> 00:05:53.090
If you strike me down here
and now, Echigo will be yours.

00:05:53.180 --> 00:05:58.020
However, before that happens,
Uesugi will surely take the land of Kaga.

00:05:58.100 --> 00:05:59.220
Are you claiming

00:05:59.310 --> 00:06:02.650
you sent your troops to the land of
Kaga while we were on our way here?

00:06:02.730 --> 00:06:05.020
I find this hard to believe!

00:06:05.110 --> 00:06:10.700
Your scouts will likely come
running soon with urgent news.

00:06:10.780 --> 00:06:14.650
However, you will not make it in time then.

00:06:14.750 --> 00:06:16.740
My lord Inuchiyo...

00:06:16.830 --> 00:06:18.790
We cannot withdraw.

00:06:18.870 --> 00:06:21.710
Lord Hideyoshi and Lord
Hanbei placed their faith in us

00:06:21.790 --> 00:06:25.380
and entrusted us with the
grave task of subjugating Uesugi!

00:06:28.760 --> 00:06:31.420
This is all for the sake of
building a strong country!

00:06:31.510 --> 00:06:34.220
However, the people of
Kaga will be held hostage.

00:06:34.310 --> 00:06:36.390
Needless to say, we will
protect our people as well!

00:06:36.480 --> 00:06:41.010
We will defeat Lord
Uesugi and then hasten back!

00:06:41.100 --> 00:06:43.520
Our opponent is the War God of Echigo.

00:06:43.610 --> 00:06:46.020
The one and only man that Lord
Takeda Shingen, the Tiger of Kai,

00:06:46.110 --> 00:06:49.320
recognizes as a peerless and worthy opponent.

00:06:49.400 --> 00:06:51.900
Even with my lord Inuchiyo 's
magnificent skills with the spear,

00:06:51.990 --> 00:06:53.980
by no means will this be easy.

00:06:55.950 --> 00:06:58.280
I, Matsu, shall undertake this task.

00:06:58.370 --> 00:06:59.500
What are you saying?!

00:06:59.580 --> 00:07:02.290
My lord Inuchiyo, please hasten back to Kaga.

00:07:02.380 --> 00:07:03.830
Do not be ridiculous!

00:07:04.500 --> 00:07:07.090
Your concern for me is unnecessary.

00:07:07.170 --> 00:07:10.340
Having defeated Date, armies
from Ashina, Nanbu, and Tsugaru

00:07:10.430 --> 00:07:12.590
will be sure to arrive here soon.

00:07:12.680 --> 00:07:14.260
However...

00:07:16.390 --> 00:07:20.850
So my opponent is to be your wife then?

00:07:20.940 --> 00:07:22.180
Yes!

00:07:22.270 --> 00:07:24.600
Please make haste, my lord Inuchiyo!

00:07:24.690 --> 00:07:26.520
Exposing the people of Kaga to such danger

00:07:26.610 --> 00:07:28.890
is the one thing that must not come to pass!

00:07:28.990 --> 00:07:31.520
Here I come.

00:07:31.610 --> 00:07:33.820
Whenever it pleases you.

00:07:40.290 --> 00:07:42.070
Wait, Matsu.

00:07:49.630 --> 00:07:52.000
We will return to Kaga.

00:08:22.710 --> 00:08:24.870
We have no choice but to fight them.

00:08:24.960 --> 00:08:26.740
Yes, Sir.

00:08:45.100 --> 00:08:46.930
So we have been surrounded.

00:08:53.200 --> 00:08:56.860
My lord Inuchiyo, could it
be possible that Lord Uesugi

00:08:56.950 --> 00:08:59.910
is attempting to make us
surrender without bloodshed?

00:08:59.990 --> 00:09:01.360
Yes...

00:09:01.450 --> 00:09:03.690
Lord Uesugi Kenshin...

00:09:03.790 --> 00:09:09.370
He is a compassionate warrior,
just as we had heard from Keiji.

00:09:09.460 --> 00:09:11.170
But be that as it may...!

00:09:16.970 --> 00:09:22.130
I cannot lay down my spear now!

00:09:22.220 --> 00:09:24.510
Crush the Uesugi Army!

00:09:42.330 --> 00:09:44.740
I am the invincible protagonist!

00:09:44.830 --> 00:09:46.910
I spent a year winning myself a reputation!

00:09:47.000 --> 00:09:50.490
Naoe Kanetsugu of Uesugi's First Unit!

00:09:50.590 --> 00:09:53.580
I have no intention of losing to the likes of...

00:09:53.670 --> 00:09:56.840
I'm invincible, but I got beat!

00:10:29.370 --> 00:10:31.160
Keiji!

00:10:33.550 --> 00:10:36.580
It does not appear that
you have come to our aid.

00:10:36.670 --> 00:10:40.260
No. If this is how you want things to be,

00:10:40.340 --> 00:10:43.800
I thought I'd likewise use force to stop you.

00:10:43.890 --> 00:10:45.750
Keiji!

00:10:45.850 --> 00:10:48.640
A win for Maeda is a win for Toyotomi.

00:10:48.730 --> 00:10:53.810
And that's just not something
I can quietly stand by and overlook!

00:10:55.440 --> 00:10:57.230
I understand.

00:10:57.440 --> 00:10:59.230
My lord Inuchiyo.

00:11:00.700 --> 00:11:03.560
Fight me in earnest, Toshi.

00:11:03.660 --> 00:11:05.610
I...

00:11:05.700 --> 00:11:07.440
...always fight in earnest!

00:11:26.180 --> 00:11:28.970
Even if you manage to subdue your opponent,

00:11:29.060 --> 00:11:32.390
someday, someone else will come to subdue you!

00:11:32.480 --> 00:11:34.340
Why can't you understand that?!

00:11:34.440 --> 00:11:36.100
It is so that such things do not happen...

00:11:36.190 --> 00:11:39.480
So that force is never used to
commit unjust deeds ever again...

00:11:40.780 --> 00:11:43.860
That is why I must fight now!

00:11:43.950 --> 00:11:45.110
Keiji!

00:11:45.200 --> 00:11:46.820
My lord Inuchiyo!

00:11:46.910 --> 00:11:48.400
Please stop this!

00:11:48.500 --> 00:11:51.030
Why must you two cross swords...

00:11:59.960 --> 00:12:02.670
Toyotomi is trying to build a strong country!

00:12:02.760 --> 00:12:06.090
If Toyotomi comes to rule,
nothing like that will ever happen again!

00:12:06.180 --> 00:12:11.670
What he's trying to create isn't
the kind of world you want, Toshi!

00:13:08.450 --> 00:13:10.240
I cannot withdraw!

00:13:23.470 --> 00:13:25.250
Keiji...

00:13:32.390 --> 00:13:34.180
My lord Inuchiyo...

00:13:41.020 --> 00:13:43.560
My lord Inuchiyo!

00:14:20.520 --> 00:14:21.100
Hideyoshi!

00:14:27.320 --> 00:14:29.860
I... cannot...

00:14:31.200 --> 00:14:32.990
Toshi...

00:14:38.670 --> 00:14:40.450
I'm sorry!

00:15:30.010 --> 00:15:32.800
On your guard, Keiji!

00:15:36.430 --> 00:15:39.550
Withdraw, Lady Matsu.

00:15:39.640 --> 00:15:43.180
The Maeda general has
been seriously wounded.

00:15:43.270 --> 00:15:45.980
Lord Uesugi...

00:15:46.070 --> 00:15:49.560
For the sake of loved
ones, for their futures...

00:15:49.650 --> 00:15:52.610
There are those who take up
the sword and those who do not...

00:15:52.700 --> 00:15:55.780
And both are right.

00:15:55.870 --> 00:15:58.360
Your nephew has
chosen not to take it up

00:15:58.450 --> 00:16:01.660
and his former friend
has chosen to take it up.

00:16:01.750 --> 00:16:04.870
As did your husband.

00:16:04.960 --> 00:16:06.700
For all to become one...

00:16:06.790 --> 00:16:13.710
Both Lord Toshiie and Keiji
wish for there to be peace for all.

00:16:13.800 --> 00:16:16.420
How ironic this is...

00:16:48.710 --> 00:16:51.250
Wake up.

00:16:51.340 --> 00:16:53.960
Wake up, guys!

00:17:10.150 --> 00:17:11.430
Number One...

00:17:11.530 --> 00:17:13.110
--Number One.
--Number One.

00:17:13.190 --> 00:17:14.350
Number One.

00:17:14.450 --> 00:17:15.980
All right.

00:17:16.070 --> 00:17:18.530
You guys did well to survive.

00:17:18.620 --> 00:17:21.110
We've taken back Oshu for now.

00:17:21.200 --> 00:17:22.990
Yes, Sir.

00:17:26.370 --> 00:17:28.160
Number One...

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:31.380
Damn it all...

00:17:31.460 --> 00:17:35.500
Only Master Katakura can
protect Number One's back...

00:17:35.590 --> 00:17:38.080
We'll go back and prepare for war.

00:17:38.180 --> 00:17:40.340
We'll be headed for Osaka.

00:17:40.430 --> 00:17:42.010
To crush Toyotomi.

00:17:42.100 --> 00:17:44.640
While we're there getting Kojuro back.

00:17:44.730 --> 00:17:46.510
Yes, Sir!

00:18:09.630 --> 00:18:11.330
Th-That's...!

00:18:11.420 --> 00:18:13.460
To... T-To...

00:18:19.180 --> 00:18:22.040
Toyotomi Hideyoshi!

00:18:24.520 --> 00:18:29.430
You've got a good attitude,
coming to greet me in person.

00:18:29.520 --> 00:18:34.010
You've saved me the trouble
of going all the way to Osaka.

00:18:34.110 --> 00:18:37.690
Snakes are more tenacious
than one might expect.

00:18:37.780 --> 00:18:40.900
No matter how poor their caliber.

00:18:41.700 --> 00:18:44.690
So you say, but your own
caliber's nothing to be proud of, either.

00:18:44.790 --> 00:18:47.030
Especially for someone of your size.

00:18:47.120 --> 00:18:48.830
So easy.

00:18:48.920 --> 00:18:51.750
You left the extermination
of a snake to your underlings,

00:18:51.830 --> 00:18:55.750
but considering how you've come
all this way to check on it yourself...

00:18:56.920 --> 00:18:59.080
It means that unfortunately for you,

00:18:59.180 --> 00:19:03.460
those eyes of yours see me
properly for the dragon that I am.

00:19:03.550 --> 00:19:06.510
A miserable retort.

00:19:06.600 --> 00:19:10.010
So you intend to defy me?

00:19:10.100 --> 00:19:12.560
When all your scales have been peeled away

00:19:12.650 --> 00:19:16.390
and you have even lost your right eye?

00:19:16.480 --> 00:19:17.850
Is that right?

00:19:17.940 --> 00:19:20.560
Looks like I overestimated you.

00:19:20.660 --> 00:19:25.150
In short, you don't know the
difference. That's what it means.

00:19:25.240 --> 00:19:26.820
Let me tell you something.

00:19:26.910 --> 00:19:31.000
You can't take a dragon's
scales until he's kicked the bucket!

00:19:31.080 --> 00:19:33.240
Not a single one!

00:19:39.170 --> 00:19:42.790
You shall suffer defeat and know your place!

00:20:06.490 --> 00:20:10.950
Master Yukimura, let us have the
men find a place to make camp soon.

00:20:11.040 --> 00:20:12.820
Agreed.

00:20:23.890 --> 00:20:26.170
Is something the matter?

00:20:26.260 --> 00:20:27.300
No, just that...

00:20:27.390 --> 00:20:28.970
Ever since we entered Omi,

00:20:29.060 --> 00:20:31.800
I feel as though all the people
here have been working ceaselessly

00:20:31.890 --> 00:20:35.140
morning, day, and night.

00:20:35.230 --> 00:20:40.820
And they are all either women,
or the elderly, or those of tender years.

00:20:40.900 --> 00:20:44.520
It is likely due to Toyotomi's conscription.

00:20:44.610 --> 00:20:48.030
They say that under Toyotomi,
soldiers are rounded up in one place

00:20:48.120 --> 00:20:51.830
and are put through unimaginably
rigorous military training.

00:20:51.910 --> 00:20:56.750
I had heard of this from Sasuke as well, but...

00:21:04.380 --> 00:21:09.590
I mustn't. Right now, I must go
with the troops my lord entrusted to me

00:21:09.680 --> 00:21:14.470
and go straight to Satsuma to
foil Toyotomi's sinister designs.

00:21:14.560 --> 00:21:18.520
If I concerned myself with
every person I came across...

00:21:23.950 --> 00:21:27.530
Master Oyamada, I shall be right back.

00:21:49.430 --> 00:21:53.170
I am... sorry...

00:21:57.770 --> 00:22:00.980
This... voice...

00:22:03.650 --> 00:22:05.440
It is all...

00:22:06.400 --> 00:22:08.610
It is all...

00:22:08.700 --> 00:22:10.480
...Ichi's fault.

00:23:41.620 --> 00:23:43.740
This castle...

00:23:43.830 --> 00:23:44.460
...is my brother's grave marker.

00:23:47.210 --> 00:23:48.790
So please let him rest in peace.

00:23:51.260 --> 00:23:53.420
Oh...

00:23:53.510 --> 00:23:56.000
Next time, it will all be Ichi's fault again.
